      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Analytical query layer \u2014 13 business queries on the SDI mart\nEach query is timed (`time.perf_counter()` around execute + fetch) on three tiers: **Postgres staging** (what analysts had before the warehouse), the **star schema**, and the **optimised star** (pre-aggregated summary tables, junk-dimension pre-filters, re-clustered fact). All tiers return identical results (checked automatically by the benchmark)."
      }
